<title>USA: IPO FILING-RIT files for 2.25 mln shares.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING-RIT files for 2.25 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>RIT Technologies Ltd filed Tuesday with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission to register an initial public offering of up to 2.25 million ordinary shares it expects to sell at between $7.50 to $9.50 a share.</p>
<p>The underwriters for the offering, Unterberg Harris and Pennsylvania Merchant Group Ltd, have an over-allotment option of up to 337,500 shares.</p>
<p>The Tel Aviv maker of computer network wiring products said proceeds from the sale will be used for general corporate purposes, including financing expansion.</p>
<p>After the offering, the company will have 8,305,050 shares outstanding, of which the company's current directors and officers will hold a 46.4 percent stake.</p>
</text>
